<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Python Trailhead &mdash; a 6-month, day-by-day roadmap</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Newsreader:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#F1F4EE;
    --card:#FFFFFF;
    --ink:#1E2A22;
    --ink-soft:#4B5A50;
    --pine:#2C6E5A;
    --pine-dark:#1E4E3F;
    --amber:#ffa703;
    --amber-dark:#A97A22;
    --moss:#C3D2BD;
    --moss-soft:#E7EDE3;
    --dusk:#5C7A8A;
    --radius:14px;
    --maxw:820px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    *{transition-duration:0.001ms !important; animation-duration:0.001ms !important;}
  }
  body{
    margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Newsreader', Georgia, serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4,summary .wk-title{font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;}
  .mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace;}
  a{color:var(--pine-dark);}
  :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset:2px;}

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    background:linear-gradient(175deg, var(--pine) 0%, var(--pine-dark) 100%);
    color:#F6F8F4; padding:38px 20px 34px; border-radius:0 0 26px 26px;
    position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:.10; pointer-events:none;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, #fff 0, transparent 40%),
                       radial-gradient(circle at 85% 75%, #fff 0, transparent 35%);
  }
  .hero-inner{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:0 auto; position:relative;}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.14em;
    text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--amber); margin:0 0 10px;
  }
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(1.7rem, 5vw, 2.5rem); line-height:1.1; margin:0 0 10px; font-weight:700;}
  .hero h1 span{color:var(--amber);}
  .hero p.lede{
    font-family:'Newsreader', serif; font-style:italic; font-size:1.05rem;
    max-width:46ch; color:#DCE7DD; margin:0 0 24px;
  }
  .stat-row{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px 22px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .stat{min-width:96px;}
  .stat .num{font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:1.35rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff;}
  .stat .lab{font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#B9CFC2;}

  /* trail */
  .trail{position:relative; margin:34px 6px 6px; height:56px;}
  .trail-track{position:absolute; top:24px; left:0; right:0; height:6px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.22); border-radius:5px;}
  .trail-fill{position:absolute; top:24px; left:0; height:6px; width:0%; background:var(--amber); border-radius:5px; transition:width .5s ease;}
  .waypoint{position:absolute; top:0; transform:translateX(-50%); text-align:center; width:70px;}
  .wp-dot{display:block; width:15px; height:15px; margin:6px auto 6px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--pine-dark); border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.65);}
  .waypoint.complete .wp-dot{background:var(--amber); border-color:var(--amber); box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(217,165,68,.28);}
  .wp-label{font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:.07em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#C7D9CB;}

  .overall-row{display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-top:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  #overall-pct{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-weight:700; font-size:1.6rem; color:var(--amber);}
  #overall-count{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; color:#CFE0D2;}
  .milestones{display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:14px;}
  .milestone{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10.5px; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:20px;
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); color:#CFE0D2;
  }
  .milestone.hit{background:var(--amber); border-color:var(--amber); color:#3A2A08; font-weight:700;}
  #reset-progress{
    margin-top:16px; background:none; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); color:#DCE7DD;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:20px; cursor:pointer;
  }
  #reset-progress:hover{border-color:var(--amber); color:var(--amber);}

  /* ---------- HOW IT WORKS ---------- */
  .howto{
    max-width:var(--maxw); margin:-20px auto 0; padding:0 16px; position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .howto-card{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--moss); border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:22px 22px 20px; box-shadow:0 10px 24px -18px rgba(30,42,34,.35);
  }
  .howto-card h3{margin:0 0 12px; font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--pine-dark);}
  .howto-card ul{margin:0; padding-left:0; list-style:none;}
  .howto-card li{
    padding:8px 0 8px 26px; position:relative; font-size:.95rem; color:var(--ink-soft);
    border-top:1px solid var(--moss-soft);
  }
  .howto-card li:first-child{border-top:none;}
  .howto-card li::before{content:"→"; position:absolute; left:0; color:var(--amber-dark); font-weight:700;}
  .howto-card b{color:var(--ink); font-weight:600;}

  /* ---------- CAMP / MONTH ---------- */
  .camp{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:44px auto 0; padding:0 16px;}
  .camp-head{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--moss); border-radius:var(--radius);
    padding:24px 22px 20px;
  }
  .camp-eyebrow{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--dusk);}
  .camp-head h2{font-size:1.4rem; margin:6px 0 8px; color:var(--pine-dark); line-height:1.25;}
  .camp-goal{font-style:italic; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 16px; max-width:62ch;}
  .camp-bar-track{height:8px; border-radius:6px; background:var(--moss-soft); overflow:hidden;}
  .camp-bar-fill{height:100%; width:0%; background:var(--pine); border-radius:6px; transition:width .4s ease;}
  .camp-pct{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:8px;}

  /* ---------- WEEK ---------- */
  .weeks{margin-top:6px;}
  .week{
    background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--moss); border-radius:12px;
    margin-top:14px; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .week summary{
    cursor:pointer; list-style:none; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;
    padding:15px 18px; user-select:none;
  }
  .week summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .week summary::after{
    content:"+"; margin-left:auto; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:16px;
    color:var(--dusk); flex-shrink:0; transition:transform .2s ease;
  }
  .week[open] summary::after{content:"–";}
  .wk-num{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--pine-dark);
    background:var(--moss-soft); padding:4px 9px; border-radius:20px; flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .wk-title{font-weight:600; font-size:1.02rem; color:var(--ink);}
  .wk-progress{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-soft);
    border:1px solid var(--moss); border-radius:20px; padding:3px 9px; flex-shrink:0;
  }
  .week.complete .wk-progress{background:var(--amber); border-color:var(--amber); color:#3A2A08; font-weight:700;}
  .week-body{padding:0 18px 20px;}
  .wk-goal{color:var(--ink-soft); font-style:italic; margin:0 0 16px;}
  .meta-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-bottom:18px;}
  @media (max-width:560px){.meta-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .meta-block{background:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--moss-soft); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 14px;}
  .meta-block h4{margin:0 0 6px; font-size:.78rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--dusk); font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;}
  .meta-block p{margin:0; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink);}
  .meta-block ul{margin:0; padding-left:18px; font-size:.9rem; color:var(--ink);}
  .meta-block li{margin-bottom:3px;}

  /* ---------- DAY ---------- */
  .day-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .day{
    display:flex; gap:12px; padding:13px 14px; border:1px solid var(--moss-soft);
    border-radius:10px; background:#FDFEFC; transition:opacity .25s ease, background .25s ease;
  }
  .day.done{opacity:.5; background:var(--moss-soft);}
  .day.done .topic{text-decoration:line-through; text-decoration-color:var(--pine);}
  .day-check{flex-shrink:0; padding-top:2px; cursor:pointer;}
  .day-check input{position:absolute; opacity:0; width:1px; height:1px;}
  .box{
    display:block; width:23px; height:23px; border-radius:6px; border:2px solid var(--moss);
    background:#fff; position:relative;
  }
  .day-check input:checked + .box{background:var(--pine); border-color:var(--pine);}
  .day-check input:checked + .box::after{
    content:"✓"; position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    color:#fff; font-size:14px; font-weight:700;
  }
  .day-check input:focus-visible + .box{outline:3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset:2px;}
  .day-body{flex:1; min-width:0;}
  .day-head{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; margin-bottom:5px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .dow{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-weight:700; font-size:12px; color:var(--pine-dark); text-transform:uppercase;}
  .hrs{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10.5px; color:#fff; background:var(--dusk); padding:2px 8px; border-radius:20px;}
  .absday{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; color:var(--ink-soft); opacity:.65; margin-left:auto;}
  .topic{margin:0 0 6px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:.98rem; line-height:1.35;}
  .line{margin:0 0 4px; font-size:.9rem; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.4;}
  .tag{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em;
    padding:1.5px 7px; border-radius:10px; margin-right:7px; display:inline-block;
  }
  .tag-out{background:var(--moss-soft); color:var(--pine-dark); border:1px solid var(--moss);}
  .tag-do{background:#FBF0DA; color:var(--amber-dark); border:1px solid #EAD3A0;}

  /* ---------- TRAIL KIT / FOOTER ---------- */
  .kit{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:52px auto 0; padding:0 16px;}
  .kit h2{color:var(--pine-dark); font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .kit > p{color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:0; max-width:60ch;}
  .kit-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; margin-top:18px;}
  @media (max-width:560px){.kit-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .kit-card{background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--moss); border-radius:12px; padding:16px 18px;}
  .kit-card h4{margin:0 0 9px; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:.78rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; color:var(--dusk);}
  .kit-card ul{margin:0; padding-left:18px; font-size:.92rem; color:var(--ink);}
  .kit-card li{margin-bottom:5px;}

  footer{max-width:var(--maxw); margin:40px auto 60px; padding:0 16px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:.85rem; text-align:center;}
  footer .sig{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; color:var(--pine-dark); font-weight:600;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="eyebrow">A self-paced learning roadmap 2026</p>
    <h1>The Python <span>Trailhead</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">A 6-month, day-by-day route from your first line of code to a finished, portfolio-ready project — six base camps, twenty-four weeks, one destination.</p>

    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">24</div><div class="lab">Weeks</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">168</div><div class="lab">Learning days</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">~264</div><div class="lab">Total hours</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">~11</div><div class="lab">Hrs / week</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="trail">
      <div class="trail-track"></div>
      <div class="trail-fill" id="trail-fill"></div>
      <div class="waypoint" data-waypoint="1" style="left:16.6667%;"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span class="wp-label">Camp 1</span></div><div class="waypoint" data-waypoint="2" style="left:33.3333%;"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span class="wp-label">Camp 2</span></div><div class="waypoint" data-waypoint="3" style="left:50.0000%;"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span class="wp-label">Camp 3</span></div><div class="waypoint" data-waypoint="4" style="left:66.6667%;"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span class="wp-label">Camp 4</span></div><div class="waypoint" data-waypoint="5" style="left:83.3333%;"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span class="wp-label">Camp 5</span></div><div class="waypoint" data-waypoint="6" style="left:100.0000%;"><span class="wp-dot"></span><span class="wp-label">Camp 6</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="overall-row">
      <span id="overall-pct">0%</span>
      <span id="overall-count">0 / 168 days complete</span>
    </div>
    <div class="milestones">
      <span class="milestone" data-threshold="25">25%</span>
      <span class="milestone" data-threshold="50">50%</span>
      <span class="milestone" data-threshold="75">75%</span>
      <span class="milestone" data-threshold="100">🏁 100%</span>
    </div>
    <button id="reset-progress" type="button">Reset all progress</button>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="howto">
  <div class="howto-card">
    <h3>How the trail works</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Pace:</b> Monday–Friday is roughly 1.5 focused hours. Saturday is a longer ~2.5&nbsp;hr project day. Sunday is a lighter ~1&nbsp;hr review day — consolidate, don't cram.</li>
      <li><b>Order matters:</b> work top to bottom. Every mini-project and capstone deliberately reuses code from earlier weeks.</li>
      <li><b>The pace is a guide, not a law:</b> if a topic needs two days instead of one, take them. Understanding beats speed, every time.</li>
      <li><b>Before Day 1:</b> install Python 3.12+ and VS Code, and create a free GitHub account.</li>
      <li><b>Tracking progress:</b> tick a day off once you've done the practice task, not just read the topic. Progress saves automatically in this tab.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>


    <section class="camp" id="camp-1" data-month="1">
      <div class="camp-head">
        <div class="camp-eyebrow">Month 1 &middot; Weeks 01&ndash;04</div>
        <h2>Base Camp 1 · Python Foundations</h2>
        <p class="camp-goal">Get your environment running and learn how Python actually thinks — variables, input, and basic operations.</p>
        <div class="camp-bar-track"><div class="camp-bar-fill" data-camp-fill="1"></div></div>
        <div class="camp-pct" data-camp-pct="1">0% of this camp complete</div>
      </div>
      <div class="weeks">
      <details class="week" data-week="1" data-month="1">
        <summary>
          <span class="wk-num">Week 01</span>
          <span class="wk-title">Getting Started &amp; Core Basics</span>
          <span class="wk-progress" data-week-progress="1">0/7</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="week-body">
          <p class="wk-goal">Set up your coding environment and write your first working scripts.</p>
          <div class="meta-grid">
            <div class="meta-block">
              <h4>Tools this week</h4>
              <p>Python 3.12+ (python.org), VS Code + Python extension, your terminal</p>
            </div>
            <div class="meta-block">
              <h4>Theory to read</h4>
              <ul><li>Official Python tutorial — “Using the Python Interpreter”</li><li>W3Schools — Python Intro &amp; Syntax</li><li>Real Python — “Python Basics” overview</li></ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="day-list">
          <li class="day" data-week="1" data-month="1">
            <label class="day-check" for="c-1-1">
              <input type="checkbox" id="c-1-1" class="track"
                     data-week="1" data-month="1" data-abs="1">
              <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
            <div class="day-body">
              <div class="day-head">
                <span class="dow">Mon</span>
                <span class="hrs">1.5 hrs</span>
                <span class="absday">Day 1/168</span>
              </div>
              <p class="topic">Install Python &amp; VS Code; run your first script; get comfortable in the terminal</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-out">You'll be able to</span>Your environment is ready and you&#x27;ve executed real Python code</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-do">Try it</span>Print 5 different messages, including one with your name and age</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="day" data-week="1" data-month="1">
            <label class="day-check" for="c-1-2">
              <input type="checkbox" id="c-1-2" class="track"
                     data-week="1" data-month="1" data-abs="2">
              <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
            <div class="day-body">
              <div class="day-head">
                <span class="dow">Tue</span>
                <span class="hrs">1.5 hrs</span>
                <span class="absday">Day 2/168</span>
              </div>
              <p class="topic">Variables &amp; data types — int, float, str, bool; naming rules</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-out">You'll be able to</span>Declare and use variables confidently</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-do">Try it</span>Build a “profile card” using variables (name, age, city) and print it</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="day" data-week="1" data-month="1">
            <label class="day-check" for="c-1-3">
              <input type="checkbox" id="c-1-3" class="track"
                     data-week="1" data-month="1" data-abs="3">
              <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
            <div class="day-body">
              <div class="day-head">
                <span class="dow">Wed</span>
                <span class="hrs">1.5 hrs</span>
                <span class="absday">Day 3/168</span>
              </div>
              <p class="topic">Type casting and your first input() calls</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-out">You'll be able to</span>Take input from a user and convert it between types</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-do">Try it</span>Build a simple age calculator (ask birth year → calculate age)</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="day" data-week="1" data-month="1">
            <label class="day-check" for="c-1-4">
              <input type="checkbox" id="c-1-4" class="track"
                     data-week="1" data-month="1" data-abs="4">
              <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
            <div class="day-body">
              <div class="day-head">
                <span class="dow">Thu</span>
                <span class="hrs">1.5 hrs</span>
                <span class="absday">Day 4/168</span>
              </div>
              <p class="topic">Arithmetic operators and operator precedence</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-out">You'll be able to</span>Comfortable doing math inside a program</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-do">Try it</span>Build a basic 4-operation calculator using input()</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="day" data-week="1" data-month="1">
            <label class="day-check" for="c-1-5">
              <input type="checkbox" id="c-1-5" class="track"
                     data-week="1" data-month="1" data-abs="5">
              <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
            <div class="day-body">
              <div class="day-head">
                <span class="dow">Fri</span>
                <span class="hrs">1.5 hrs</span>
                <span class="absday">Day 5/168</span>
              </div>
              <p class="topic">Comments, PEP8 basics, writing code that reads cleanly</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-out">You'll be able to</span>Understand the conventions professional Python looks like</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-do">Try it</span>Refactor Mon–Thu&#x27;s scripts so they follow PEP8</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="day" data-week="1" data-month="1">
            <label class="day-check" for="c-1-6">
              <input type="checkbox" id="c-1-6" class="track"
                     data-week="1" data-month="1" data-abs="6">
              <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
            <div class="day-body">
              <div class="day-head">
                <span class="dow">Sat</span>
                <span class="hrs">2.5 hrs · project day</span>
                <span class="absday">Day 6/168</span>
              </div>
              <p class="topic">Practice day: combine variables, input, casting and operators</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-out">You'll be able to</span>Your first real mini project, built from this week&#x27;s pieces</p>
              <p class="line"><span class="tag tag-do">Try it</span>Build a BMI Calculator (height + weight in → BMI + category out)</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="day" data-week="1" data-month="1">
            <label class="day-check" for="c-1-7">
              <input type="checkbox" id="c-1-7" class="track"
                     data-week="1" data-month="1" data-abs="7">
              <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </label>
            <div class="day-body">
              <div class="day-head">
                <span class="dow">Sun</span>
                <span class="hrs">1 hr · review</span>
                <span class="absday">Day 7/168</span>
              </div>
